<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios - Feb 3.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios - Feb 3.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Highest and lowest price earnings ratios for Australian companies included in the 320-company All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on January 31. P/E based on rolling 12 months earnings.</p>
<p>Highest 10</p>
<p>Rank Name		    P/E	 Close</p>
<p>1   Tourism Asset	 3600.00    1.08</p>
<p>2   Portman Min	    357.14    2.25</p>
